= Lecture 7: Aharonov-Bohm Effect

== Aharonov-Bohm Effect
== Basic Set Up

We consider a double split experiment with a solenoid in the middle.
The magnetic field is confined in the solenoid, and the particle can
only go through the two slits outside the solenoid.

If we assume that the there's no electric field and electric
potential. The lagrangian of the particle in this systems is given by:
$
    L = 1/2 m dot(r)^(2) + e dot(r) dot A
$

